{"counts":{"canonical":62,"context":0,"total":62,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Vedic Age","历史分期","宗教传统"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ca9294b7753aa283a4226b07","summary":"吠陀时代是南亚历史中的长期阶段，教材采用约公元前一七〇〇至六〇〇年的范围，以吠陀宗教文本得名。相关叙述把这一阶段放在哈拉帕城市衰落之后，关注讲印度雅利安语言的人群迁入旁遮普，并逐渐向恒河流域扩展、同原有居民互动的过程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700年—公元前600年","end_year":-600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"南亚吠陀时代"},{"aliases":["Chavin (Archaeological Site)","祭祀建筑","石构工程"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["查文文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-34088c0f4e147299b1e2cc92","summary":"查文遗址坐落在秘鲁安第斯山的高山谷地，并为查文文化命名。这里的台地、广场和石砌建筑构成宗教仪式中心，内部还有廊道、通风设施与排水网络。建筑及石雕中反复出现人形、兽形图像，是理解当地宗教表达的实物线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前300年","end_year":-300,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"查文文化营建石构祭祀建筑"},{"aliases":["Jinsha Site","古蜀","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-2692aab5d3b5a97775bd9c9e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2692aab5d3b5a97775bd9c9e","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-17c6c026103edfd278a0158a","summary":"金沙遗址位于成都西部，是认识古蜀社会的重要考古地点。世界遗产预备名单申报说明把其兴起和放弃的大致时间列为公元前一二〇〇至六五〇年，指出它在三星堆之后发展，河流把宫殿性质区域与宗教祭祀区域分在南北两侧，西面另有居住区和墓地。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1200—前650年","end_year":-650,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1200},"title":"金沙遗址的古蜀聚落"},{"aliases":["Kamegaoka Burial Site","丧葬","祭献"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-72858a91fe58887c00990a28","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-72858a91fe58887c00990a28","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-479b480f918388998561b723","summary":"龟冈遗址位于日本青森县津轻半岛的低丘，面向曾经的内湾环境，年代约为公元前一〇〇〇至四〇〇年。台地上分布多组土坑墓，出土陶器、宝石等供献品和随葬品；墓地长期使用，被官方介绍解释为持续祭祖活动的迹象。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1000—前400年","end_year":-400,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1000},"title":"龟冈群体营建墓地并埋置祭献物"},{"aliases":["散盤 / Pan water vessel of San","土地","契约","金文"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-70f49cfd9972c1386d37a8cf","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-70f49cfd9972c1386d37a8cf","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-f3c3a67f8901a0dc32953a65","summary":"散盘是西周晚期的一件青铜水器，盘内三百五十字铭文以契约式内容著称。台北故宫的释读认为，铭文起于夨方攻打散邑所造成的纷争，随后以割让两区田地作为补偿，记录双方踏勘土地、树立界标及见证人员的情况。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前9—前8世纪（馆方页面范围不一）","end_year":-701,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-900},"title":"散盘铭文中的割地与履勘契约"},{"aliases":["Nok Culture","陶塑","冶铁"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["诺克文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-2b8886893ec7797c24feb829","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2b8886893ec7797c24feb829","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d4ce959ef2dd86e0198c7883","summary":"诺克文化的主要阶段，研究者弗兰克置于约公元前九至四世纪。这一划分结合尼日利亚中部遗址的放射性碳年代、发光测年和陶器比较；它所指的是整组考古材料的发展阶段，而不是每一件陶塑都具有相同的制造年代。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前9世纪至前4世纪","end_year":-301,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-900},"title":"诺克主要阶段出现陶塑人物与冶铁生产"},{"aliases":["Manunggul Jar","陶器","二次葬","船形图像"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-f4b2238401f700e3fa1edfb5","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f4b2238401f700e3fa1edfb5","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-bedc1d9f83c80b6251cbaf25","summary":"马农古尔陶罐出自菲律宾巴拉望岛的马农古尔洞穴，是盛放死者遗骸的葬器，资料定年约为公元前八九〇至七一〇年。罐体以陶土制成，上部曲线纹饰用赤铁矿红色颜料强调；最引人注目的部分，是盖上立体塑造的船与两个人物。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前890—前710年","end_year":-710,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-890},"title":"马农古尔制陶者制作双人船形盖葬罐"},{"aliases":["Douroula","冶铁","金属技术"],"body":[],"categories":["科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-e4c391b8897de93f653c7d9b","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-e4c391b8897de93f653c7d9b","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7218187ec39ba80a3f19452f","summary":"杜鲁拉遗址位于今布基纳法索，保存了可追溯至公元前八世纪的冶铁证据。世界遗产说明把它列为目前在该国辨认出的最早铁生产材料，其早期炉基受到保护。这里的年代指已发现的生产遗存，并不自动等于整个西非首次发明冶铁的时间。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前8世纪","end_year":-701,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-800},"title":"杜鲁拉出现早期冶铁生产遗存"},{"aliases":["春秋战国时期","历史分期","诸侯竞争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-edf85701b555b76400b51322","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-edf85701b555b76400b51322","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6bb393b8e3a5c25e9407c288","summary":"春秋战国是从周王室东迁到秦统一之间的漫长阶段，本条沿国博展览采用约公元前七七〇至二二一年。王室权威与西周礼制逐渐变化，春秋诸侯争霸、战国强国兼并相继展开；这些变化跨越数百年，不能理解为周平王迁都之后各地制度立即相同。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前770—前221年","end_year":-221,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-770},"title":"春秋战国：诸侯竞争的历史背景"},{"aliases":["十九作祠陳寶。","祭祀"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-6d4a4bd856002cf8456b5537","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"秦","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6d4a4bd856002cf8456b5537","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c2c12e7e3bab668f26e00487","summary":"《史记·十二诸侯年表》记秦文公十九年设祠祭陈宝，《秦本纪》则简记这一年得到陈宝。较详细的《封禅书》说，文公获得一件仿佛石头的物体，在陈仓北面的坡地筑祠奉祀，称为陈宝。其得物、筑祠和奉祀被连在一起叙述，构成这项地方祭祀的起源故事。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前747年","end_year":-747,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-747},"title":"秦设陈宝祭祀"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-c71d8bc246b09364bc79c3d1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-c71d8bc246b09364bc79c3d1","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-168f42ea53deb8061ebf9386","summary":"公元前745年，提格拉特帕拉沙尔三世登上亚述王位，纪年官编年史把即位记在阿亚鲁月。此前王室驻地卡尔胡出现叛乱，王位更替与高官的更换发生在这一政治动荡背景中。不过，古代材料对其亲缘给出不同说法，现代学者对他是合法继承还是夺位，也仍有不同解释。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前745年","end_year":-745,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-745},"title":"提格拉特帕拉沙尔三世即位"},{"aliases":["晉昭侯元年封季父成師于曲沃，曲沃大於國，君子譏曰：「晉人亂自曲沃始矣。」","封邑","晋国内争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-72dedcdf8d922e0a1ae374f1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"曲沃","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-72dedcdf8d922e0a1ae374f1","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-77020f9636ebf95960bf116b","summary":"晋昭侯即位之初，把曲沃封给叔父成师。《史记·晋世家》称曲沃的规模超过晋君所在的翼，成师因此成为拥有大邑的宗室支系，号为曲沃桓叔，并由栾宾辅佐。书中还说成师在当地颇得人心，封邑的实力与国君本支之间由此形成了紧张关系。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前745年","end_year":-745,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-745},"title":"晋昭侯封成师于曲沃"},{"aliases":["Tiglath-Pileser III","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述","乌拉尔图"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-98afce5e1c1ef37a4a60c22e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-98afce5e1c1ef37a4a60c22e","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-02ceb60f06c69508757b861b","summary":"公元前743年，提格拉特帕拉沙尔三世的军队在北叙利亚同乌拉尔图国王萨尔杜里二世及其盟友交战。联军包括阿尔帕德、梅利德和古尔古姆等力量，反映乌拉尔图与亚述在这片地区的竞争。亚述取得胜利，扭转此前在同一地区受到压制的局面；纪年官表将战事概括在阿尔帕德附近。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前743年","end_year":-743,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-743},"title":"提格拉特帕拉沙尔三世在阿尔帕德附近击败乌拉尔图国王"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-31d3950998c2aa4a19630c2b","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-31d3950998c2aa4a19630c2b","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7d481e378b1ffdeccc7c0c6e","summary":"公元前739年，亚述军队向北部乌鲁巴方向出征，纪年官表记下一处堡垒被夺。米拉梅尔吉崖刻以国王第七次出征定位同一行动，残文叙述军队穿越山口、攻击当地城市，并追击逃入伊利梅鲁山的人群。叙述中包含掠夺和征服宣称，应按亚述王室记录的立场阅读。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前739年","end_year":-739,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-739},"title":"亚述军队向乌鲁巴出征并夺取堡垒"},{"aliases":["潘父殺昭侯，納成師，不克。昭侯子立，是為孝侯。","政变","晋国内争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-824ab9f0c88c157f9bc12217","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"晋","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-824ab9f0c88c157f9bc12217","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d125b64b4a344d3a562af5a5","summary":"晋昭侯七年，大臣潘父杀害昭侯，打算迎立受封曲沃的成师。成师即曲沃桓叔，是晋君的宗室长辈，拥有强大的封邑。《史记》说，桓叔试图进入晋国政治中心时，却遭晋人发兵抵抗，进取失败，只能返回曲沃；潘父企图借弑君改变君位归属的行动并未实现。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前739年","end_year":-739,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-739},"title":"潘父杀晋昭侯，迎纳成师未成"},{"aliases":["Biskupin","木构建筑","聚落营建"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-d4b8fac173c10ed2c67b269f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d4b8fac173c10ed2c67b269f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cb6f457ba3fd142f3bca58ec","summary":"比斯库平遗址位于今波兰的湖岸半岛，湿润的泥炭和湖泊环境保存了大量木构遗迹。当地博物馆介绍指出，建筑所用多数木料来自公元前七三八至七三七年冬季的砍伐；这里记录的是木材取得的季节范围，并非每栋房屋的准确完工日期。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前738／737年冬季","end_year":-737,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-738},"title":"比斯库平建造者冬季集中采伐建筑木料"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-285045e6e4f2d33e693ea847","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-285045e6e4f2d33e693ea847","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7c12f2f2084c342cdad383fa","summary":"公元前733年，提格拉特帕拉沙尔三世再次向阿兰—大马士革出兵。这场行动属于亚述逐步控制黎凡特的过程：此前沿海和平原地区已受军事压力，大马士革同外部援助和交通网络的联系随之受到削弱，但仍是地区重要政权，并得到若干邻近力量的支持。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前733年","end_year":-733,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-733},"title":"亚述军队向大马士革出征"},{"aliases":["二弟州吁驕，桓黜之，出奔。","王室冲突","流亡"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","人物"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-42337972bd68aad97c599351","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"卫","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-42337972bd68aad97c599351","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-46fc9751b754a2f990470c4a","summary":"卫桓公继位后，曾废黜同父异母的弟弟州吁，州吁随后出奔。《十二诸侯年表》将此事列在桓公二年，即公元前733年，并以州吁骄纵作为背景。这里的出奔发生在后来弑君之前，说明卫国君位之争并非突然出现，而是经历了宗室成员失势、离国再谋取权力的过程。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前733年","end_year":-733,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-733},"title":"卫桓公黜州吁，州吁出奔"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-5f816bd02ab1f73ef431979a","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-5f816bd02ab1f73ef431979a","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4d69fe7f452007624332cb8d","summary":"公元前731年，亚述军队向沙皮亚方向出征。此时比特阿穆卡尼部族首领纳布穆金泽里取得巴比伦王位，试图整合南部不同势力，提格拉特帕拉沙尔三世则把这一变化视为对亚述在当地地位的挑战。沙皮亚同这位首领的祖居及抵抗活动联系在一起，成为随后争夺的重要地点。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前731年","end_year":-731,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-731},"title":"亚述军队向沙皮亚出征"},{"aliases":["九曲沃桓叔成師卒，子代立，為莊伯。","宗室继承"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","人物"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-9e612078a879f33d823da81e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"曲沃","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-9e612078a879f33d823da81e","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d9584dd0bd1ec276d3b88acd","summary":"曲沃桓叔成师去世后，其子继掌曲沃，号为庄伯。《十二诸侯年表》将这次继承记在公元前731年。成师原是晋文侯之弟，由晋昭侯分封到曲沃；这个大邑逐渐形成足以与晋君本支对抗的宗室势力。桓叔之死，并没有使曲沃重新归入翼都国君的直接控制。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前731年","end_year":-731,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-731},"title":"曲沃桓叔成师去世，其子继立"},{"aliases":["十九公卒，命立弟和，為穆公。","君位继承"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","人物"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-9791ca5f7c58cec0fb7d1ab2","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"宋","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-9791ca5f7c58cec0fb7d1ab2","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-aaea7006abdae1230db3f2b2","summary":"宋宣公去世时，没有让儿子与夷直接继位，而命弟弟和接掌宋国，是为宋穆公。《十二诸侯年表》将这一安排列在公元前729年。君位由兄传弟，在这一事件中是宣公主动指定的继承方案；后来宋国围绕与夷、穆公之子冯的争议，也与这次安排密切相关。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前729年","end_year":-729,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-729},"title":"宋国国君去世，弟和继立为穆公"},{"aliases":["Tiglath-Pileser III","征服"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["两河流域"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-b5f433271634c4c3e9077498","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b5f433271634c4c3e9077498","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-34ec97d5a011d5c1db24bc32","summary":"公元前729年，提格拉特帕拉沙尔三世在连续数年与纳布穆金泽里的竞争后，取得巴比伦并接受当地王冠。此前穆金泽里以南部部族力量为基础称王，亚述则通过军事封锁、进军和争取城市支持等方式逐步削弱其地位。夺取巴比伦，使亚述国王同时成为巴比伦的君主。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前729年","end_year":-729,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-729},"title":"提格拉特帕拉沙尔三世征服巴比伦尼亚"},{"aliases":["十六曲沃莊伯殺孝侯，晉人立孝侯子卻為鄂侯。","晋国内争","君位继承"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-c86a5b6a9e7456f7821ded9e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"晋","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-c86a5b6a9e7456f7821ded9e","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-62e9a009eb1566ee22ea088d","summary":"曲沃桓叔成师死后，其子庄伯继承封邑，并继续与晋君所在的翼争夺权力。《史记》记载，庄伯攻入翼，杀害晋孝侯。《十二诸侯年表》将这件事记在公元前724年，并接着记录晋人另立鄂侯为君。曲沃发动的弑君行动，因而没有立即带来君位的顺利转移。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前724年","end_year":-724,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-724},"title":"曲沃庄伯杀晋孝侯"},{"aliases":["夏五月，鄭伯克段于鄢。","国内冲突"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-17e88ff8469b71907257f7c0","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"鄢","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-17e88ff8469b71907257f7c0","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-0af7ce954178cb905202d6c0","summary":"郑庄公即位后，母亲武姜为自己偏爱的幼子段请求封邑，段遂居京，并逐渐把西部、北部边地纳入自己的控制。《左传》记，段整备兵车，准备袭击郑都，武姜打算为其开门接应。庄公获知行动日期后，命子封出兵，先攻京，再追击退往鄢的段。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前722年","end_year":-722,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-722},"title":"郑国国君在鄢击败段"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-d09f8070a7e393bed60ea47d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d09f8070a7e393bed60ea47d","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-437a7f1cbd694b998b17da2f","summary":"亚述军队向哈提地区开展军事行动；现存文本中的目标地名由现代校勘者作部分复原。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前721年","end_year":-721,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-721},"title":"亚述军队向哈提出征"},{"aliases":["秋八月庚辰，公及戎盟于唐。","外交会盟"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-431ab71ab900a44ce59554c2","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"唐","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-431ab71ab900a44ce59554c2","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-096615f2abc1f3e9fd355528","summary":"鲁隐公二年，鲁国与戎人之间的盟约经历了先会见、后立盟的过程。《左传》记，春天隐公在潜与戎会面，是为了延续鲁惠公时期的友好；戎人当时请求结盟，隐公没有同意。到了秋天，对方再次提出请求，双方才在唐举行盟会，重修原有关系。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前721年","end_year":-721,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-721},"title":"鲁隐公与戎在唐结盟"},{"aliases":["冬十有二月，齊侯，鄭伯盟于石門。","外交会盟"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-d30b7d5fff1a43a25e3f4d97","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"石门","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d30b7d5fff1a43a25e3f4d97","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4416332691429f7768fe7366","summary":"鲁隐公三年冬，齐侯与郑伯在石门结盟。《左传》说明，这次盟会是在重申此前卢地所订的盟约，因此不是两国关系毫无前情的新开端。《春秋》将双方国君及结盟地点同时记下，保留了齐、郑在春秋初年直接建立政治联系的具体节点。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前720年","end_year":-720,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-720},"title":"齐郑在石门结盟"},{"aliases":["戊申，衛州吁弒其君完。","政权更替"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-4e70ee1835a79aebb9067769","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"卫","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4e70ee1835a79aebb9067769","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8db0857b2b2a757ed554d56b","summary":"卫国公子州吁是卫庄公宠妾之子，曾因骄纵被卫桓公废黜出奔。鲁隐公四年，他杀害桓公并自行立君。《左传》记，州吁想借对郑作战取得诸侯支持、安定国内，于是与宋国接洽，联合陈、蔡等国出兵；对外用兵成为他巩固新地位的一种手段。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前719年","end_year":-719,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-719},"title":"卫州吁弑君"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-8ad61e4ddf25b33058134172","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-8ad61e4ddf25b33058134172","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-1728eb17b0c46f324ed02c98","summary":"公元前718年前后，萨尔贡二世对塔巴尔地区实施军事干预。塔巴尔包含多个城邦，并非始终统一的国家；在亚述、乌拉尔图和弗里吉亚竞争下，当地统治者不断调整依附关系。根据学术研究对铭文的整理，萨尔贡废黜拒交贡物的希努赫图国王基亚基，并将其领地交给阿图纳的库尔提。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前718年","end_year":-718,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-718},"title":"亚述军队进攻塔巴尔"},{"aliases":["宋人伐鄭，圍長葛。","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-a19e8861c28bf5b5d939d631","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"长葛","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a19e8861c28bf5b5d939d631","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3171db54fe01bf50114c5d3e","summary":"宋军围攻长葛，发生在宋、郑接连相互报复的战事中。《左传》记，宋国先取邾田，邾人请郑出兵；郑又以周王军队会同邾军攻入宋国外城。宋国向鲁求援时，因使者对战况的说明激怒鲁隐公，援助未能实现，宋国随后转而进攻郑地长葛。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前718年","end_year":-718,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-718},"title":"宋军围攻长葛"},{"aliases":["冬，宋人取長葛。","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-daed4bb98aaf05a4916f8ab0","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"长葛","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-daed4bb98aaf05a4916f8ab0","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cbe2434771fabebe5e615943","summary":"鲁隐公六年，宋国取得郑地长葛，承接此前宋、郑之间的攻守冲突。上一年，郑军曾会同邾军攻入宋国外城，宋军随后围长葛以报复；这一年，记载从围攻转为攻取，说明长葛争夺已经出现新的结果，而非重复登记同一次出兵。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前717年","end_year":-717,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-717},"title":"宋国攻取长葛"},{"aliases":["Carchemish","征服"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述","叙利亚新赫梯诸国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-d149eef7c8d30bf7a2a60de8","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d149eef7c8d30bf7a2a60de8","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-dd616d0905267f2dfd8f2050","summary":"公元前717年，萨尔贡二世攻占卡尔凯美什，当时该国由皮西里统治。亚述王以皮西里背叛自己、联系敌对势力为理由发动进攻。城市控制幼发拉底河的重要渡口，处在地中海沿岸、安纳托利亚与亚述之间的交通交会处，长期贸易使这个规模不大的王国积累了可观财富。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前717年","end_year":-717,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-717},"title":"萨尔贡二世征服卡尔凯美什"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6e819ce925711ee1a526ec6c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6e819ce925711ee1a526ec6c","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-f8985b4b5fe23d19d0debe1d","summary":"公元前716年，亚述军队向曼奈人的城市开展军事行动。曼奈处在亚述与乌拉尔图的竞争地带，当地王位更替和地方势力的结盟不断影响边区形势。补充学术叙述把这年的萨尔贡行动同曼奈内部冲突联系起来：乌鲁苏努一度寻求乌拉尔图支持，亚述随后攻击曼奈都城伊齐尔图。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前716年","end_year":-716,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-716},"title":"亚述军队进攻曼奈人的城市"},{"aliases":["戎伐凡伯于楚丘，以歸。","外交冲突"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-451c637c47b6d25f15932b1f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"楚丘","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-451c637c47b6d25f15932b1f","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6509de924efc1592621c6a28","summary":"鲁隐公七年冬，周王派凡伯到鲁国聘问。凡伯返程经过楚丘时，遭戎人攻击并被带走。《左传》为此追述此前的一次接触：戎人曾赴周朝见，向公卿送礼，凡伯却没有以宾客之礼接待他们。这段往事被传文放在袭击之前，作为理解冲突的前情。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前716年","end_year":-716,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-716},"title":"戎袭击周使凡伯"},{"aliases":["秋，七月，庚午，宋公、齊侯、衛侯盟于瓦屋。","外交会盟"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-f6b87cee835c78aeeab4daa1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"瓦屋","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f6b87cee835c78aeeab4daa1","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-89f9a18cbf724ea664bee6b8","summary":"鲁隐公八年，齐侯安排调解宋、卫与郑的关系。宋、卫先行会见，随后各方在温会合，齐、宋、卫三国国君又于瓦屋订盟。《左传》把这次调解与此前宋、卫攻郑东门引起的纷争联系起来，称它是为消解旧日战事造成的敌对，而不是记一次没有前因的诸侯聚会。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前715年","end_year":-715,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-715},"title":"宋齐卫在瓦屋结盟"},{"aliases":["Urartu–Assyria War","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述","乌拉尔图"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-370f5e1cff4175e421752f84","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-370f5e1cff4175e421752f84","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-49b4ffffd0f0dd3c6bbddbf5","summary":"公元前714年，萨尔贡二世发动向乌拉尔图的第八次远征，军队行经曼奈王国南部边区，得到当地供给粮食，随后攻击齐基尔图。乌拉尔图国王鲁萨与其盟友米塔蒂组织抵抗，双方在乌阿乌什山附近交战，联军败退，亚述军队继而向乌鲁米耶湖周边推进。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前714年","end_year":-714,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-714},"title":"萨尔贡二世向乌拉尔图发动攻势"},{"aliases":["夏，城郎。","城邑建设"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-2f447f7c793a590fd903346a","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"郎","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2f447f7c793a590fd903346a","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d5d37d24c61043f6fc7e19f8","summary":"鲁隐公九年夏，鲁国修筑郎邑城防，《春秋》以城郎记下此事。郎的城防工程此前已经出现过：《左传》说隐公元年费伯曾率军修城，因为没有得到国君命令，未列入经文正文。九年的记载因而不能简单理解为郎邑从此才第一次出现。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前714年","end_year":-714,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-714},"title":"鲁国修筑郎城"},{"aliases":["六月，壬戌，公敗宋師于菅。","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-3b77905ca04f98d4a797a4d9","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"菅","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-3b77905ca04f98d4a797a4d9","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-47ba4f82581cdb399306f9c5","summary":"鲁隐公十年，鲁、齐、郑先在中丘会面，继而订约安排共同出兵。夏季，鲁公子翚先行与齐、郑会师伐宋，鲁隐公随后加入，并在菅击败宋军。这次交战承接鲁、宋关系破裂和郑国奉王命讨宋的争端，是诸侯协同行动中的一个具体战场。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前713年","end_year":-713,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-713},"title":"鲁国在菅击败宋军"},{"aliases":["Arslantepe","战争","城市"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述","新赫梯梅利德"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-88367554ddff29be491380ec","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-88367554ddff29be491380ec","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-e9d8da9beb9d133131d04cb4","summary":"公元前712年，萨尔贡二世统治下的亚述军队攻击梅利德。王室铭文指责当地统治者塔尔胡纳齐违背誓约、停止贡物，并宣称攻毁其王城及周边聚落，随后从蒂尔加里姆堡垒带走国王、家属、财物和被俘战士。这些内容反映亚述以征服叙事解释对附属政权的处置。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前712年","end_year":-712,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-712},"title":"萨尔贡二世洗劫梅利德"},{"aliases":["秋，七月，壬午，公及齊侯、鄭伯入許。","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-a9d772e0cca878d82b38fe0a","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"许","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a9d772e0cca878d82b38fe0a","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-a6a5bd3819e6291d23911836","summary":"鲁隐公十一年，鲁、齐、郑联合进攻许国。此前鲁隐公与郑庄公会于郲，商议伐许，郑国随后在大宫授兵。攻城时，颍考叔持旗先登，却被同军中的子都射落，瑕叔盈再举旗登城，郑军随之攻入，许庄公逃往卫国。联军获胜的过程，也夹杂着郑军内部的争执。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前712年","end_year":-712,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-712},"title":"鲁齐郑联军进入许国"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-d30a1068c769e5c72fcd2d82","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d30a1068c769e5c72fcd2d82","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-1a34c68a09871ada5c068538","summary":"公元前711年，亚述军队进攻古尔古姆都城马尔卡萨。萨尔贡二世的王室铭文把出兵同当地王位更替联系起来：继承人穆塔卢杀害塔尔胡拉拉后，未经亚述王同意即位，遂被作为干预的理由。纪年官表则以简短的年度行动，确认马尔卡萨是当年的军事目标。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前711年","end_year":-711,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-711},"title":"亚述军队进攻马尔卡萨"},{"aliases":["三月，公會鄭伯于垂，鄭伯以璧假許田。","土地与外交"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-3f2c7df456e6b66014b2f321","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"垂","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-3f2c7df456e6b66014b2f321","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-fdf5d100cacdc6710bac4e50","summary":"鲁桓公即位后，鲁、郑重新修好，并继续交涉此前尚未完成的土地交换。《左传》记，郑请求恢复祭祀周公、最终办成祊田与许田之易，鲁桓公表示同意。三月，两国国君在垂会见，郑庄公又以玉璧交涉许田，《春秋》用假字记这项安排。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前711年","end_year":-711,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-711},"title":"郑鲁在垂会面并交涉许田"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a386c1828ae46f0fa382acf7","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a386c1828ae46f0fa382acf7","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-a153ccee28c0b4eb4cf1f668","summary":"亚述军队向比特泽里开展军事行动；同一年度条目还记载亚述国王停留在基什。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前710年","end_year":-710,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-710},"title":"亚述军队进攻比特泽里"},{"aliases":["宋督弒其君與夷及其大夫孔父。","政权更替"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-615c4608f8a7991044098148","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"宋","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-615c4608f8a7991044098148","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-214d020f20bc8379f8f17842","summary":"宋国大宰华父督先攻大司马孔父之家，杀孔父并夺其妻；宋殇公对此发怒，华父督又杀殇公。《左传》把这场政变放在宋国连年作战、民众难以承受的背景中，记华父督事先将战争负担归咎于孔父，从而利用国内不满发动攻击。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前710年","end_year":-710,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-710},"title":"宋督弑君并杀孔父"},{"aliases":["秋七月壬辰朔，日有食之，既。","天文记录"],"body":[],"categories":["科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-0fc09465566ed2a43ac58860","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-0fc09465566ed2a43ac58860","record_type":"topic","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c9624ac2866aee144801b09c","summary":"《春秋》在鲁桓公三年记下“秋七月壬辰朔，日有食之，既”，其中保留月份、干支和月初信息。现代研究将其对应到公元前七〇九年的日全食；“既”被理解为太阳被全部遮住，使这条短记载成为研究古代日食的重要材料。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前709年","end_year":-709,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-709},"title":"《春秋》桓公三年所记日食"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-d9660eb7362616c6d61d4a0a","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d9660eb7362616c6d61d4a0a","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8046d7044d7503ea6e823415","summary":"《亚述纪年官编年史》把萨尔贡二世执贝尔神之手的仪式记在公元前709年。此事位于他取得巴比伦王冠之后，显示新统治关系也通过参加神祇祭仪来表达。国王的仪礼活动同巴比伦的神庙秩序和城市权利相连，执手这条简记虽然保存了正式参与祭仪的节点，却没有交代全部仪式程序。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前709年","end_year":-709,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-709},"title":"萨尔贡二世举行贝尔神执手礼"},{"aliases":["公子翬如齊逆女。","政治婚姻"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-a12e8ba2ffe834fb84e1ded3","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"齐","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a12e8ba2ffe834fb84e1ded3","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-114256286328146903159bb6","summary":"鲁桓公三年，鲁国先与齐侯在嬴会面，议定婚事，秋天再派公子翚前往齐国迎接新夫人。九月，齐侯亲自把姜氏送到讙，鲁桓公也到那里相会，姜氏随后进入鲁国。这场迎亲由大夫先行、两国国君会面和夫人入鲁等环节组成，体现婚姻与国家交往的结合。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前709年","end_year":-709,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-709},"title":"鲁公子翚前往齐国迎亲"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-d0c5112d971fde0adbdeb965","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d0c5112d971fde0adbdeb965","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-88ec3fdbe8c1193677b76721","summary":"公元前708年，亚述方面攻占库穆胡，并在当地任命行省总督。萨尔贡二世的王室铭文指责国王穆塔卢停止贡赋、依靠乌拉尔图，随后宣扬征服都城及周边据点的战果。穆塔卢本人逃走，王室家属、财物及当地人口则遭到控制与迁移，原有附属王国的安排发生改变。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前708年","end_year":-708,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-708},"title":"亚述攻占库穆胡并设置行省总督"},{"aliases":["夏，天王使宰渠伯糾來聘。","外交往来"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-0737a090c6afcb264ae97d13","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"鲁","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-0737a090c6afcb264ae97d13","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-483aba215fc7196de62f124c","summary":"鲁桓公四年夏，周天子派宰渠伯纠到鲁国聘问。《春秋》以天王遣使的方式记下这次来访，说明它属于王室与诸侯国之间的正式往来。《公羊传》把来使解释为天子的大夫，进一步称其为下大夫；这提供了理解使者身份的一种古代说法。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前708年","end_year":-708,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-708},"title":"周王遣宰渠伯纠聘鲁"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-8e0eb5328b1be0e99f1c31f2","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-8e0eb5328b1be0e99f1c31f2","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-832745473a62ac8a20892d45","summary":"公元前707年，杜尔沙鲁金的诸神像进入各自神庙，纪年官编年史把这一活动记在塔什里图月。新都神庙的开礼，是萨尔贡二世营建王室城市的重要阶段。宗教庆典使新建的空间进入正式祭祀秩序，也把国王、神庙与不同城市的神祇联系在一起。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前707年","end_year":-707,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-707},"title":"杜尔沙鲁金神像进入各自神庙"},{"aliases":["戰于繻葛","战争","周王室与诸侯"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-8b660d7a85be6ba5e398018d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"繻葛","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-8b660d7a85be6ba5e398018d","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-63e2fb0f30a8743ecd50758f","summary":"周桓王削去郑庄公的卿士职权后，郑庄公不再朝见，双方矛盾终于发展为战争。鲁桓公五年秋，周王联合蔡、卫、陈出兵伐郑，亲领中军，由虢公林父统右军、周公黑肩统左军。郑军据陈国内乱、军心不稳等情形拟定应对，分左右两拒配合中军迎战。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前707年","end_year":-707,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-707},"title":"繻葛之战：郑军击败周王军队"},{"aliases":["Dur-Sharrukin","都城","迁都"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-21a421bf1903cd73b84d3e5f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-21a421bf1903cd73b84d3e5f","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-f738d2482dda38c2809b93d2","summary":"公元前706年，萨尔贡二世的宫廷迁往新建城市杜尔沙鲁金，意为萨尔贡的堡垒。城市的王宫、神庙和军械库分置在巨大台基上，城墙设有七座纪念性城门，规划较既有旧城更为整齐。配套工程还包括灌溉与农业供给，以支撑迁入居民及王室机构的生活。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前706年","end_year":-706,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-706},"title":"亚述宫廷迁往杜尔沙鲁金"},{"aliases":["秋，八月，壬午，大閱，蔡人殺陳佗。","军事制度"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-5376cc069d703997bb4409f2","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"鲁","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-5376cc069d703997bb4409f2","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-117cc1d5b9e1e01429b93878","summary":"鲁桓公六年秋，鲁国举行大阅。《左传》用检视车马解释这一活动，《公羊传》则说检阅车与徒卒，二者都将它理解为军事力量的检视，而非记录一次已经发生的对外战争。《春秋》特意列出此事，也使鲁国军备活动进入了逐年的政治记述。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前706年","end_year":-706,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-706},"title":"鲁国举行大阅"},{"aliases":["夏，穀伯綏來朝，鄧侯吾離來朝。","外交往来"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-86c328baead70c1f97ce1e8d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"鲁","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-86c328baead70c1f97ce1e8d","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d8d3423961488a5c82f8225c","summary":"鲁桓公七年，谷伯绥与邓侯吾离到鲁国朝见。《春秋》将两位来访国君分别具名记录，所说的来朝是从鲁国立场记诸侯赴鲁，与诸侯前往周王室的朝见不是同一对象。谷、邓两国在这段记载中以国名、爵称和人名同时出现，留下了一次较具体的诸侯交往记录。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前705年","end_year":-705,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-705},"title":"谷伯与邓侯来鲁朝见"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bcf6d4e8c2a654d3aa360d29","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bcf6d4e8c2a654d3aa360d29","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-e7a65a416c7afdb7f08648e5","summary":"公元前705年，萨尔贡二世在北方战事中死亡，辛那赫里布继承亚述王位。纪年官编年史把即位记在阿布月十二日。旧王战死并失去遗体，是这次王位交替的重要背景；辛那赫里布此前已作为王储承担国家事务，新君需要接续的不只是王冠，也包括父王留下的战争与营建工程。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前705年","end_year":-705,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-705},"title":"辛那赫里布继承亚述王位"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-04115c8da5cf69714c761930","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-04115c8da5cf69714c761930","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7a4e8adcc73333101541e28a","summary":"亚述编年史记载基利济城的王宫在这一年修建完成；附近残缺文字没有提供更多建筑细节。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前704年","end_year":-704,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-704},"title":"基利济王宫建成"},{"aliases":["祭公來，遂逆王后于紀。","政治婚姻"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-f0010f61d6f0b7cd24817fa8","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"纪","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f0010f61d6f0b7cd24817fa8","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ad59dd434f9661de6803f800","summary":"鲁桓公八年冬，祭公先到鲁国，随后前往纪国迎接周王的王后。《左传》把这项迎亲视为合礼，《春秋》则用先来鲁、遂往纪的连续记法，保存了使臣行程中的两个环节。纪国的女子后来进入周王室，说明王室婚姻也需要通过诸侯国及使臣之间的往来完成。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前704年","end_year":-704,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-704},"title":"祭公赴纪迎王后"},{"aliases":["九年，春，紀季姜歸於京師。","政治婚姻"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-922eaf26fc902b0b6af03891","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"京师","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-922eaf26fc902b0b6af03891","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-f264993e42a5c96e3de5f4c2","summary":"鲁桓公九年春，纪季姜出嫁到周王所在的京师。她来自纪国，是前一年祭公赴纪迎接的王后，因而这条记载与先前的迎亲行动前后衔接。《春秋》以归字记录女子出嫁，也写明她从诸侯国进入王室这一婚姻去向。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前703年","end_year":-703,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-703},"title":"纪季姜出嫁周京师"},{"aliases":["冬，十有二月丙午，齊侯、衛侯、鄭伯來戰于郎。","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-371964f7edfacba36e4eda7e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"郎","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-371964f7edfacba36e4eda7e","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c86fe63cea39184b972d1574","summary":"鲁桓公十年冬，齐、卫、郑三国军队来到郎地与鲁国交战。《左传》把战事缘起追溯到此前援救齐国的行动：郑太子忽击败北戎立功，齐人供应诸侯军队时让鲁安排次序，鲁按周爵把郑列在后面，郑人因此发怒，后来向齐请兵，齐又联合卫军相助。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前702年","end_year":-702,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-702},"title":"齐卫郑与鲁战于郎"},{"aliases":["宋人執鄭祭仲。突歸於鄭。鄭忽出奔衛。","政权更替"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-86d672aaaabb80190796b6a4","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"郑","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-86d672aaaabb80190796b6a4","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-29b6cb035fa8b9388937585a","summary":"郑庄公去世后，祭仲拥立其子忽，即郑昭公。庄公另有一子突，其母雍姞出自宋国雍氏，雍氏在宋庄公处有势力。《左传》记，宋人诱捕祭仲，威胁他若不改立突就杀死他，同时又扣住突，索取财物；宋国由此直接介入了郑国的继承安排。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前701年","end_year":-701,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-701},"title":"宋扣留祭仲，郑突回国"},{"aliases":["Siege of Lachish","攻城","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述","犹大"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ce23ff71661a8bad908df208","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ce23ff71661a8bad908df208","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-baff204c9bee78592d1b8364","summary":"公元前701年，新亚述军队在辛那赫里布的西方远征中攻陷拉吉。拉吉是犹大王国的重要设防城市，仅次于耶路撒冷，处在亚述镇压地区反抗的进军线上。亚述军队攻击并破坏城墙，城内居民遭受杀戮和强制处置，夺城行动改变了犹大面对亚述军事压力的形势。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前701年","end_year":-701,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-701},"title":"新亚述军队攻陷拉吉"}],"revision":"7b562b96d0ccc8b5ba7df896452b7871dfa5786438c7d8c232e7723b0fb28b2d","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}